409
00:18:54,398 --> 00:18:58,279
[SPEAKER_02]: We used to give Ruth a lot of time in Chicago and get in practice, see.

410
00:18:58,319 --> 00:19:02,040
[SPEAKER_02]: We'd holler at him from our fence and go like a monkey hanging down.

411
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:06,121
[SPEAKER_02]: So we'd call him the big monkey, see, and holler at him like that.

412
00:19:06,921 --> 00:19:08,562
